# Copy to .env.local (or set in the Vercel project settings).
#
# Split deployment: the public origin of the backend (FastAPI engine).
# Leave EMPTY for local dev / single-origin mode (backend serves the
# dashboard itself) — all fetches then stay relative to the current origin.
# SECURITY: never put secrets in any VITE_* variable — these are inlined
# into the public JS bundle. The backend host holds every secret.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=